N/A — runbook is `mqc-issue-1.plan`'s.

## Verification

The issue-1 verification checklist already covers issue-6's
concerns.  Specifically:

- Test 7 (`neg-mqc-id-replay` from issue-1's test coverage) —
  the pre-fix server-side blob (literal `"mqc-id:N"` signature)
  must be rejected by the new verifier.  This is the direct
  proof that the issue-6 gap is closed.

